# Evaluation
*evaluation.ipynb
*evaluation_results.csv
evaluation/*.json
evaluation/*.csv
# ...but results.csv is a published artefact: weights/README.md and evaluation/README.md
# both cite it. The negation works because the rule above excludes FILES, not the
# directory -- git never descends into an excluded directory, so a negation inside one
# would be silently ignored.
!evaluation/results.csv

